{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">本港近日天氣酷熱，正在忙於拍攝新劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》的「兩母女」吳若希與車婉婉，亦要在高溫環境下展開外景拍攝。面對烈日當空，二人各出奇招抗暑，並先後在社交平台分享拍攝現場的搞笑花絮，以幽默自嘲的心態對抗酷熱天氣！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-17-16h13m40s547.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026KC8fCtZyNU1786957416.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-17-16h13m40s547.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">其中，吳若希日前上載了一段自製短片。片中身穿無袖上衣的她，全程手持手提風扇吹風，並展示手機畫面上的「酷熱天氣警告」，她更將經典歌曲《後來》改篇為《好曬》作為背景音樂，憑藉歌詞如「我就快彌留狀態」、「熱到想暴斃」及「底衫褲汗透黐住晒」等，生動還原高溫下爆汗的真實慘況，搞笑指數爆燈。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-17-16h14m27s300.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ZnX2XZzT781786957434.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-17-16h14m27s300.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">而在劇中飾演其媽媽「唐曹嘉冰」的車婉婉同樣要在烈日下開工。她隨後分享多張外景花絮照，只見身穿長袖襯衫的她站在巨大的藍色冷藏冰箱旁，並發揮幽默本色，大玩自己角色名字的「食字 GAG」寫道：「外景拍攝中… 熱🔥🔥🔥呢次真係要『加冰』🤪🤪🤪辛苦晒…」，展現出極佳的心理質素。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cheyuenyuen1228_1786875734_3964874114510308650_686803679.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026hFBOGCOFMW1786957453.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cheyuenyuen1228_1786875734_3964874114510308650_686803679.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T09:20:23.978136+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":384,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}